/*
 * Implements semantic validation for all indexing operations in Ymir.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - Validate index expressions on arrays, slices, pointers, maps, and classes.
 *   - Dispatch indexing to the appropriate specialized validator:
 *       • ArrayIndexValidation
 *       • SliceIndexValidation
 *       • PointerIndexValidation
 *       • MapIndexValidation
 *       • ClassIndexValidation
 *   - Handle aliasing rules for class indexers.
 *   - Validate multi-index expressions and expanded indices.
 *   - Support index assignment operations.
 *   - Manage $-context for class aliasers.
 *
 * This module is the root entry point for the `[]` operator in Ymir.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::index
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/index.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-13
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
